# pan-drag (h2-input): a 50 px drag, still held.
# The plane follows the pointer (at scale 0.5 a unit is 50 px wide, so the
# center moves one unit left); the URL is unchanged — the drag's sets are
# still inside their 200 ms debounce. Canvas center (928, 490) and content
# box measured on the reference at 1440x900 (probe §1); re-check against
# page.json's canvas box once h1/h2-plane land.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 928 490
down
move 978 490 over 80
shot pan-drag
up
wait 1200
